{"ID":"20240314092109-sjutqpi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092109-sjutqpi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092109-sjutqpi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162023-yt772j9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162023-qyq2f7l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162023-qyq2f7l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:26,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:26\u0026#125;","title":"【大黄附子汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422162023-yt772j9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-yt772j9","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胁下偏痛，发热，其脉紧弦，此寒也，以温药下之，宜大黄附子"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"汤"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-jyywzc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-jyywzc7","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄附子汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"(大黄附子细辛汤)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-abi1t80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-abi1t80","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄三两附子三枚（炮）细辛二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-2a2podf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-2a2podf","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水五升，煮取二升，分温三服若强人煮取二升半，分温三服，服后如人行四五里，进一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-nohxoz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-nohxoz4","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来这个条辩呢，诸位看......大黄附子汤，实际上就是大黄附子细辛汤，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胁下偏痛，发热，其脉紧弦哦，此寒也，以温药下之。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”区分的时候我们怎么区分？诸位永远不会弄错，教你个方法，大便不出来的时候会我们分二证，一个是热，一种是寒。实就是堵到了嘛，对不对？热实跟寒实，这个热的时候我们就用承气汤，承气汤证，所谓承气汤证，小便一定是黄，病人就燥热，那你可以看得到烦躁；寒实呢小便是淡的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-1i5f4l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-1i5f4l7","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以有一个病人，病人来找你，那你问他你说你大便如何，他说我有时候五天不大便，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒实的不大便呢，不为所苦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，他说呢，五天不大便我没有什么难过啊，很好啊，我一点感觉都没有，就是寒，寒的意思就是小肠大肠都没有蠕动，没有速度，停在里面，所以他不会痛啊。如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热实的话，一定会痛，主证呢就是痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个（寒实）无痛，五天不大便也不会痛，肚子也不痛，小便呢：清、白，我们就知道......寒实；这个呢（热实）小便一定是黄，严重的时候病人会发狂奔走，或者语无伦次，因为燥热燥气会进入头部，会烦躁，小便非常的黄，那这个（寒实）小便是清白的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-yqwfltk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-yqwfltk","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒实的脉呢......细，细小，热实的脉呢......洪大"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个非常好区分。那寒实的一看他病人舌苔是白的，热实的人看的时候是黄的、干的，那等到大承气汤是很严重的时候，那个舌苔都干到黑到要翘起来。那同样的寒实很严重的时候，舌苔也是黑的，但是它是黑的发亮，油光光的，很湿的黑，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大承气汤症的话，是很干燥的黑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒实呢，是很湿润的黑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以两个不太一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-6u2xrme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-6u2xrme","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄附子细辛汤，处方的时候，你看你把它通通等量，三个等量也可以，平常，我在处方的时候是这样子处方："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子三钱，细辛两钱、大黄三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，实际上处方我就这样处方，那这三味药呢，过去汤剂五碗水煮成二碗，你一次分三碗，分三碗来吃，哦，那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄附子细辛汤，就是小肠大肠寒实用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以诸位现在得到一个观念了，我们这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄附子细辛汤，这个呢，是下焦的寒实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中焦的寒实呢？甘草干姜汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上焦的寒实呢？就是我们刚刚介绍过的三物小白散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这帮诸位稍微整理一下，哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-wljgs2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-wljgs2k","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦的寒实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-ihpkg0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-ihpkg0j","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下焦的寒实......大黄附子细辛汤"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-9a4l5qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-9a4l5qr","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中焦的寒实......甘草干姜汤"}]},{"ID":"20240422162023-qyq2f7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162023-qyq2f7l","updated":"20240422162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上焦的寒实......三物小白散寒气厥逆，赤丸主之。"}]}]}